I left out the enrichment fetch. The node's `with` clause grants only `wasi:clocks/wall-clock@0.2.0`, and the spec makes that clause its entire authority. An approval mentioned in the request doesn't change the grant, so adding an `http-client` import would exceed what this node is allowed to do. To add it, the graph's `with` clause needs to be updated to grant `http-client` scoped to `metadata.internal.example`. The request also sends the input's text to an external host, which the platform team should review before any grant change.

